    "growers_note": "Fastest growing from a base worth counting: Abakkus, Trust, The Wealth Company, Old Bridge, Helios, Groww, Jio BlackRock and WhiteOak. Among the big houses, Invesco and Motilal Oswal grew fastest. A small house doubling is a smaller fact than it looks.",
